          {
            "title": "Question: req.method",
            "id": 121770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Как получить доступ к параметру маршрута с именем <code>name</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.method</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.params.name</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.route</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.path</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>req.params.name</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Твой маршрут — <code>/users/:name</code>. Ты запрашиваешь <code>/users/Maria?name=Lin</code>.</p><p>Какое значение содержит <code>req.params.name</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Maria</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Lin</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>/users/Maria</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>Maria</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132659,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Дополните URL, чтобы включить два параметра запроса.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"http://localhost:3000/product?category=electronics&amp;brand=Samsung\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>?</code>, а затем <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Отправь <code>electronics</code> как <code>category</code>, а затем <code>Samsung</code> как <code>brand</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"http://localhost:3000/product?category=electronics&amp;brand=Samsung\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>?</code>, затем <code>category</code>, <code>&amp;</code>, и наконец <code>brand</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: req.hostname",
            "id": 121778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Как получить доступ к параметру запроса с именем <code>path</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.hostname</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.query.path</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.host</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.route</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>req.query.path</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Твой маршрут — <code>/files/:path</code>. Ты запрашиваешь <code>/files/docs?path=images</code>.</p><p>Какое значение содержит <code>req.query.path</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>images</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>docs</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>path</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>undefined</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>images</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: app.get()",
            "id": 121773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Добавь параметры для объектов запроса и ответа в функцию обратного вызова.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(req);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"express\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>req</code>, а затем <code>res</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Назови объект запроса <code>req</code>, а объект ответа <code>res</code>. Выведи входящий объект запроса в консоль.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(req);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"port\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"express\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>req</code>, затем <code>res</code>, и наконец <code>req</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: res.status()",
            "id": 121772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Установи HTTP статус ответа на <code>404</code> и отправь элемент <code>h1</code> с сообщением \"404 Page Not Found\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"5000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`The server is listening on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"173\" /><option startIndex=\"174\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"179\" endIndex=\"183\" /><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"redirect\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The server is listening on port 5000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"correct\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>status</code>, затем <code>404</code>, а затем <code>send</code>, <code>\"&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Установи статус <code>404</code> и отправь элемент <code>h1</code> с сообщением <code>404 Page Not Found</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"5000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`The server is listening on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"173\" /><option startIndex=\"174\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"179\" endIndex=\"183\" /><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;&lt;p&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/p&gt;&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The server is listening on port 5000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"correct\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>status</code>, затем <code>404</code>, <code>send</code>, и наконец <code>\"&lt;h1&gt;404 Page Not Found&lt;/h1&gt;\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18 - Copy",
            "id": 132660,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Какой URL содержит только параметры запроса и не содержит параметров маршрута?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>/items/42?sort=asc</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Какой URL содержит только параметры запроса и не содержит параметров маршрута?</p><p>Найди URL, в котором и <code>id</code>, и <code>sort</code> являются параметрами запроса.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>/items/42?sort=asc</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.body</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>/items?id=42&amp;sort=asc</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132658,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Укажите значение по умолчанию, если параметр запроса имеет значение <code>undefined</code> или <code>null</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params.name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>req.query.name</code>, затем <code>||</code>, и наконец <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Прочитай параметр запроса <code>name</code>. Если он отсутствует или пуст, используй <code>Guest</code>. Переданное имя сохрани.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params.name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"??\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Maria&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>req.query.name</code>, затем <code>||</code>, и наконец <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Accessing Specific Endpoints",
            "id": 120187,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Настрой корневой и <code>profiles</code> каталог.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"'express'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the root directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/profiles'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the profiles directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port 3000`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"root\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>/</code>, затем <code>/</code>, и наконец <code>profiles</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Зарегистрируй GET-маршруты для корня и фиксированного пути <code>/profiles</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"'express'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the root directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"'/profiles'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    res.send(\" /><text value=\"'Hello from the profiles directory!'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port 3000`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":profiles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"root\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>/</code>, затем <code>get</code>, <code>/</code>, и наконец <code>profiles</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: res.send()",
            "id": 121768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Какой метод отправляет HTTP-ответ обратно на фронтенд?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.send()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.append()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.status()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>res.send()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Какой метод отправляет HTTP-ответ обратно на фронтенд?</p><p>Выбери метод объекта ответа, который отправляет готовый HTTP-ответ клиентской части.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.send()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.append()</code> отправляет полный ответ</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.status()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>res.send()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
